  "sandbox_stdout": "Parent: n=256, C5=0.3808989437\n\n--- Phase 1: Warmup at n=256 ---\n  C5=0.3808989437\n\n--- Phase 2: Interpolate to n=512 ---\n  Interpolated C5=0.3813816713\n\n--- Phase 3: Main accelerated subgradient at n=512 ---\n  C5=0.3810350851\n\n--- Phase 4: SLSQP polish ---\n  C5=0.3810350851\n\n--- Phase 5: Focused subgradient round 2 ---\n  C5=0.3810350423\n\n--- Phase 6: SLSQP round 2 ---\n  C5=0.3810350423\n\n--- Phase 7: Binary local search ---\n  C5=0.3810350423\n\n--- Phase 8: Perturbation exploration ---\n  C5=0.3810350423\n\n--- Phase 9: Cycle 2 ---\n  C5=0.3810350071\n\n--- Phase 10: Attempt n=1024 ---\n  Interpolated C5=0.3810679772\n  n=1024: C5=0.3810414121 (no improvement, keeping n=512)\n\n--- Phase 11: Try n=384 ---\n  n=384: C5=0.3810578106 (no improvement)\n\n--- Phase 12: Coordinate descent ---\n  C5=0.3810338434\n\n--- Phase 13: Final high-beta SLSQP ---\n  C5=0.3810338434\n\n--- Phase 14: Final micro-optimization ---\n  C5=0.3810338434\n\nFINAL: n=512, C5=0.3810338434",
